  "title": "Erdős Problem #860",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $h(n)$ be such that, for any $m\\geq 1$, in the interval $(m,m+h(n))$ there exist distinct integers $a_i$ for $1\\leq i\\leq \\pi(n)$ such that $p_i\\mid a_i$, where $p_i$ denotes the $i$th prime.\nEstimate $h(n)$.",
